Adapted from alxarafe/erbas-client at 8d1573c315e03a6edbc92bd7b3d41d851bd54ab9,
app/src/app/core-fe/themes/high-contrast/ and the catalogue in themes/themes.ts.
PROVENANCE.json records the exact original file hashes.

Changes: public runtime ports and neutral projection replace consumer classes,
services and slot registries; selectors/styles are scoped to the active theme.
Alternative implements its own BOOLEAN port without a default implementation
base class. Cyberpunk's rail is in flow and native controls use a dark color
scheme. Vintage has no components. High Contrast styles only its own panel and
active default composition. No reference checkout or QA branch is a build input.
